sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Client
    participant GW as API Gateway (Rate Limiter)
    participant Auth as Auth Service
    participant BL as JTI Blacklist Store
    participant DB as MongoDB (Users)

    Note over User,DB: Login & Token Issuance
    User->>GW: POST /auth/login (username, password)
    GW->>Auth: Validate Credentials
    Auth->>DB: Fetch user record (Argon2id verify)
    DB-->>Auth: User Validated
    Auth->>Auth: Generate JWT with unique JTI claim
    Auth-->>User: 200 OK (Access Token + Refresh Token)

    Note over User,DB: Authenticated Request Inspection
    User->>GW: GET /chat/conversations (Bearer Token)
    GW->>BL: Check if JTI is in Blacklist
    BL-->>GW: Not Blacklisted
    GW->>Auth: Verify JWT signature & expiration
    Auth-->>User: 200 OK (Conversations List)

    Note over User,DB: Instant Global Logout / Revocation
    User->>GW: POST /auth/logout (Bearer Token)
    GW->>Auth: Process Logout
    Auth->>BL: Add JTI to Blacklist Store (TTL = Token Expiry)
    Auth->>DB: Update user.revoked_before = NOW()
    Auth-->>User: 200 OK (Logged out globally)

    Note over User,DB: Stolen Token Replay Attempt
    User->>GW: GET /chat/conversations (Reused Stolen Token)
    GW->>BL: Check JTI in Blacklist
    BL-->>GW: MATCH FOUND (Blacklisted)
    GW-->>User: 401 Unauthorized (Token Revoked)
